# dsh-ffm image build context
#
# The image only needs: docker/dsh-ffm/ (the payloads + helpers) and
# freqtrade-fleet-manager/ (the plugin — package.json, cordis.patch.yml,
# README, LICENSE, lib/). Everything else is noise.
.git
**/.git
freqtrade/
.vibe/
.github/workflows/*.yml
.github/workflows/*.yaml

# node/yarn/pnpm + python hygiene (never ship a dev tree into the context)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# secrets & local scratch — keep out of the context and image history
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*id_rsa*
**/.secrets
**/known_hosts
*.log
.DS_Store